sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Customer/Guest
  participant S as Showtime API
  participant B as Booking API
  participant P as Mock Payment
  U->>S: Hold seats
  S-->>U: HoldId + expiresAt
  U->>B: Checkout with holdId
  B->>S: Verify hold
  S-->>B: Valid + quote
  B-->>U: pending_payment
  U->>B: Start payment
  B->>P: Create intent
  P-->>U: Payment UI
  P->>B: Signed webhook
  B->>B: Verify HMAC + deduplicate
  B->>S: Confirm seat allocation
  alt Seat confirmed
    S-->>B: Confirmed
    B-->>U: Ticket + QR
  else Expired/conflict
    S-->>B: Rejected
    B-->>U: Refund pending / support
  end


%% ACCEPTED: 8 physical seat IDs max; couples require 2 linked IDs; 5min hold; mock HMAC webhook; cancellation >=120min (D-05..D-15).
